      "comment": "INEXORABLE (3) put the writing on the wall two runs ago then improved again last start when she scored over 2080m at this track, getting home by 3.5 metres after leading. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Finds a tougher race but she has the ability to make it two on the trot. KATIE LORRAINE (6) is an in-form mare who has managed three wins and one minor placings from four starts this campaign. Turned in another fine effort last start when she finished third over 1609m at this track, beaten 13 metres. Good enough to put herself in the winners' stall. ROMEO (5) is worth plenty of thought off a last-start win by 3.5 metres at Riverina Paceway over 1740m. Include in combinations.",
